+      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hello &amp;amp; &lt;b&gt;world&lt;/b&gt; &amp;#39;q&amp;#39; &amp;#337;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>nope</pubDate></item></channel></rss>`;
